Description: Brave web browser (prebuilt aarch64 release, VA-API ready)
 Brave is a Chromium-based web browser that blocks ads and trackers by default.
 .
 This package repackages Brave's official arm64 Linux release under /opt/brave-bin
 and installs a launcher, desktop entry, icons and an AppArmor profile. The
 launcher enables Wayland (Ozone) and hardware video decode, so playback is
 accelerated whenever the iris-vaapi package is installed.
